{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3497","id":4640956148,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz888AAAABFJ9e9A","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3497","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3497.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3497.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3497","number":3497,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"db: release the IPv4 address when IPv6 allocation fails in Next","user":{"login":"iSerganov","id":41109559,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMTA5NTU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41109559?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov","html_url":"https://github.com/iSerganov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"IPAllocator.Next took the allocator mutex once per address family. When the IPv6 allocation failed, the IPv4 address had already been added to usedIPs and prev4 had moved past it, so the address stayed reserved until headscale restarted even though no node held it.\r\n\r\nAllocate both families under a single critical section, and on an IPv6 failure remove the IPv4 address from usedIPs and restore prev4.\r\n\r\n- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\r\n- [ ] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n- [x] added unit tests\r\n- [ ] added integration tests\r\n- [ ] updated documentation if needed\r\n- [ ] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n","created_at":"2026-09-25T17:47:11Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:47:12Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"de5e68d883a3b31592865a308b1e3c72aae7adac","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/repos","events